==Trivia==
*Ancient Egg: N001 is the only Ancient Egg to have released without a [[True Form]]. The Egg itself was added in [[Version 11.4 Update|Version 11.4]], but it had no True Form until [[Version 11.5 Update|11.5]].
*The English names of Ancient Eggs: N001 and N005 didn't have colons until [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]].
*Ancient Egg: N002 is currently the only Ancient Egg number that is skipped over.
**It is possible that N002 is intended to be [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N]], as [[Idi:Re]]'s description refers to her as "Subject 002". Another proof is that [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N]] has the "N", alongside with all the Ancient Eggs.
*Ancient Eggs: N003, N004, and N005 are currently the only Ancient Eggs whose True Forms do not have Behemoth Slayer despite needing Behemoth Stones to evolve.
*Ancient Eggs: N202, N204, N206 and N004 are currently the only Ancient Eggs whose Evolved and True Forms affect more than one trait with their abilities.
**Despite targeting both [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] and [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemies, Cinnabar Egg: N202's name and coloration suggest only Red.
**Despite targeting both [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] and [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemies, Cinnabar Egg: N204's name and coloration suggest only Red.
**Despite targeting both [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] and [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies, Cinnabar Egg: N206's name and coloration suggest only Red.
**Despite targeting only Traited enemies, Mystic Egg: N004's name and coloration suggest it targets Traitless.
*Prior to [[Version 11.10 Update|Version 11.10]], all Ancient Egg units' Normal and Evolved Forms cost 750¢ instead of 180¢ and had far worse stats.
*The Catnip Challenges that award Ancient Eggs: N104, N105 and N106 have the same grammatical error: they say "Clear [x] '''of''' Behemoth Culling stages for the first time".
*Sprites and animations for Ancient Eggs corresponding to each standard enemy type were added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]], but most were initially unused, with the [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] egg still being unimplemented even as of [[Version 15.5 Update|15.5]].
**The [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]], [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] and [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] Egg's sprites and animations went unused until [[Version 11.6 Update|Version 11.6]].
**The [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] Egg's sprites and animations went unused until [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8]].
**The [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] Egg's sprites and animations went unused until [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]].
**The [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] Egg's sprites and animations went unused until [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]].

